-The game renders through `hookshot_vk.dll` (`RX_BACKEND` unset or `vulkan`) instead of the WebGPU renderer in the executable
+The game renders through `open-ocarina_vk.dll` (`RX_BACKEND` unset or `vulkan`) instead of the WebGPU renderer in the executable
